      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of your failure now rests squarely on your shoulders, crushing any hope for redemption. Without a kingdom to protect or enemies to face, your purpose has vanished alongside the fire and the ash. In this absolute silence, there is no one left to hear your sorrow, only the empty throne watching over your ruin.",
